{%- comment -%}
  SHADEO product card badges, driven by product tags (lowercase):
    polarized  → "Polarized"
    new        → "New"
    bestseller → "Bestseller"

  Render inside snippets/card-product.liquid, inside the <div class="card__badge ..."> element
  (see 01-THEME-SETUP.md, step 6):
    {% render 'shadeo-card-badges', product: card_product %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if product.tags contains 'new' -%}
  <span class="badge shadeo-badge shadeo-badge--new">New</span>
{%- endif -%}
{%- if product.tags contains 'bestseller' -%}
  <span class="badge shadeo-badge">Bestseller</span>
{%- endif -%}
{%- if product.tags contains 'polarized' -%}
  <span class="badge shadeo-badge shadeo-badge--polarized">Polarized</span>
{%- endif -%}
